  "width": 1920,
  "height": 1080,
  "frames": 2729,
  "duration_seconds": 90.96666666666667,
  "cues": [
    {
      "cue_id": "EP007-C01",
      "text": "那天我对她说，先守住这扇门，里面有我，也有你。当夜，夏凛不肯睡卧室。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/speed1p3/EP007-C01.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "c38edc4215fef9057188fb2c4228cf2ad372329f42ca53d75907a39e665e83c8",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.0069791666666665,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 181,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 0,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/EP007-C01.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "af4fac6e5d024761f82853ea597a80e438f08e74064639c1ff220758b0cec225",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "sample_count": 288335
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP007-C02",
      "text": "她在沙发旁铺了一层垫子，手握短棍，眼睛盯着门。我给她煮了碗面，端过去，她说不饿。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/speed1p3/EP007-C02.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "2e3c0086b53ec105982413442101dae3b55d64ddc1a2e93d93c6d3ed69dacccc",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.834625,
      "start_frame": 184,
      "end_frame": 390,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/EP007-C02.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "058fad80d23355481fbdf78d229a12156c5df098d1b7f4b962a5884d4815f6b3",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.9,
      "sample_count": 328062
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP007-C03",
      "text": "等我转身去整理货架，她已经把面吃完，连汤都没剩。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/speed1p3/EP007-C03.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "b43b27927070baf4dc6993e4d29ac178f9a359c810d3ae63b51c387688e38e8a",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "start_frame": 393,
      "end_frame": 509,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/EP007-C03.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "43c0de073aa0316f55a362d849dd4c0fc2b2b2f29754376ceaac7c0ea48e975b",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "sample_count": 184320
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP007-C04",
      "text": "后半夜，我出来收碗。她靠着墙坐着，头一点一点，短棍滑到了垫子上。我给她盖上毯子，没叫醒她。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/speed1p3/EP007-C04.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "3989cea68016815ee6e0dcc7376fe0e14d9bca2ab3c5c80c81e8b1a1573f11cd",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.467375,
      "start_frame": 512,
      "end_frame": 737,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/EP007-C04.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "320bd710ae84f71871ce53e678cbcafa87727c8e982581c0afbab1a7215c13dd",
      "source_duration_seconds": 9.7,
      "sample_count": 358434
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP007-C05",
      "text": "手机弹出一行提示，住客深度睡眠六小时，安心值，加二十。原来，安心值是这么算的。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/speed1p3/EP007-C05.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "56722d261e93f6d0b2c67b78691ab6d5a0db5942275847a1f34afb76ca04f14f",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.632645833333333,
      "start_frame": 740,
      "end_frame": 939,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/EP007-C05.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "8796f109c95e3a35b0f23c4d3c4202e851e8f6ca48541b2a0218911f1864421c",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.6,
      "sample_count": 318367
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP007-C06",
      "text": "清晨，她猛地惊醒，抄起短棍，问我，我睡了多久？我说，六个小时。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/speed1p3/EP007-C06.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "3c6f91c1ed2bf6b9c96b65ebfb36b853c2b5776a3f88ad3828fd28da22248ba4",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.7786875,
      "start_frame": 942,
      "end_frame": 1116,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/EP007-C06.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "f599c1b55da73a34e63f2c85db524b13617e0e679e587c2c6f7fdfbe6384ba1b",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "sample_count": 277377
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP007-C07",
      "text": "她脸色很难看，说，退役以后，我从来没连着睡过三个小时。我把热豆浆推到她面前，她沉默地接了过去。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/speed1p3/EP007-C07.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "f478dc2054d7781a1606c1048a418a6f2820803ef5a0664cf1bb1c1c618d90a3",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.4535833333333334,
      "start_frame": 1119,
      "end_frame": 1343,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/EP007-C07.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "af7e3f19f7cc37fcd62c52bcbe4a44f9dac66ac033c1cc77eda3c7e59f6d4b80",
      "source_duration_seconds": 9.7,
      "sample_count": 357772
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP007-C08",
      "text": "升级条件，五千物资点，二十安心值，刚好够。我按下了确认。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/speed1p3/EP007-C08.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "2b272c39fcee489cdef68edbe441593f87da9be56ab66cd1460fde155a153526",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.147895833333333,
      "start_frame": 1346,
      "end_frame": 1501,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/EP007-C08.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "ced61334546acaeeb54adea86c919ea9867123b3f45cb268e6b52a52134bdc30",
      "source_duration_seconds": 6.7,
      "sample_count": 247099
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP007-C09",
      "text": "脚下轻轻一震，白墙向外展开。厨房，浴室，四间卧室，木地板一块一块铺开。夏凛站在原地，短棍举起来，又放下。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/speed1p3/EP007-C09.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "e897ef7b3d01a15b005b0b6f6a2e7e9695c20bbe3d5cc5c007eeab0de2d7cb06",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 9.450666666666667,
      "start_frame": 1504,
      "end_frame": 1788,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/EP007-C09.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "80a964f2b1a62b2830f935a6d39c823b0653250693005289cd9a794697903623",
      "source_duration_seconds": 12.3,
      "sample_count": 453632
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP007-C10",
      "text": "我拧开浴室的龙头，热水冒着白气。末世前八十天，我洗上了第一个热水澡，忍不住唱了两句，破音。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/speed1p3/EP007-C10.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "94db1bdef8fe5c5354261b3625ec06ed1db76fd93048a917f65af43e53fbdde2",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.932520833333333,
      "start_frame": 1791,
      "end_frame": 1999,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/EP007-C10.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "0354f291f02f7451d376ec1e957688ac942c278b3c3d523e0f0a0e11c129c7c6",
      "source_duration_seconds": 9.0,
      "sample_count": 332761
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP007-C11",
      "text": "门外，夏凛抱着手臂。我听见她，很轻地笑了一声，又立刻压了下去。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/speed1p3/EP007-C11.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "38bd04eac0161feee409072e89d87532462770a20acf36dc1e56652125ebde7e",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.377416666666667,
      "start_frame": 2002,
      "end_frame": 2164,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/EP007-C11.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "f1f1b981553e754d26031dde58cda9fc6a6804929fb9c081346e6063984a8f13",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "sample_count": 258116
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP007-C12",
      "text": "出来以后，手机提示，下一级，需要安心值五百。屋里现在，只有一位住客。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/speed1p3/EP007-C12.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "18f2cdd0bb61488d08ea269421b195a8ac6f192634f6c3b37eba4134202ceb29",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.7755625,
      "start_frame": 2167,
      "end_frame": 2341,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/EP007-C12.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "8d8613d9e7a7bb14f5df0446ca30afd39e12de3c66c82267c0646ad6f67a6922",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "sample_count": 277227
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP007-C13",
      "text": "我擦着头发说，我得找更多人。夏凛问，找谁？我说，能让这间屋，住满的人。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/speed1p3/EP007-C13.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "4a9632dcf5e6f60b5e065ffbf1d415d2d25d0a631d7aa2ab73d056fd1a6a2b09",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.804291666666667,
      "start_frame": 2344,
      "end_frame": 2519,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/EP007-C13.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "42a2c5c9a34c7348eee3c2c3523b318fd104111978121f93f1738e336af9470f",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.592938,
      "sample_count": 278606
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP007-C14",
      "text": "我低头，看着角落里那个空医疗箱。水，粮，灯，都有了，唯独缺一个，会用它的人。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/speed1p3/EP007-C14.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "e25564ed81b628100182b46625dc2ff2f3b00d8bdd4fdf48b0f186b565fa2227",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.897458333333334,
      "start_frame": 2522,
      "end_frame": 2729,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP007/audio/EP007-C14.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "74c99d2beaa494ba9654d6b689c32596d5f4a5476698c1ceeb0570ad304b51ca",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.99775,
      "sample_count": 331078
    }
  ],
